Jake Lloyd has publicly stated that he left acting primarily due to severe online bullying and harassment following his role as Anakin Skywalker. The negative attention, especially from internet trolls, led to anxiety and a desire to step away from the spotlight. He later pursued other interests outside of acting, citing mental health as a key reason for his departure.  
\boxed{A}
